INT. PIZZA PLACE - DAY

PRIYA
(checking her phone, then the door)
ok its 3:02 and nobody from the chat has shown up. this is so cringe

JAYDEN
(sliding into the booth, hood up)
Priya? Its me. Jayden. "xX_sk8rboi_Xx" lol

PRIYA
(staring)
you're my HALF BROTHER?? you told me you were 19 and lived in Denver

JAYDEN
(wincing as a waiter drops a tray nearby)
I said I was nineteen in the chat because everybody there was older okay

PRIYA
(typing furious, thumbs flying)
im telling mom right now

MOONBEAM (V.O.)
(from Priya's phone speaker, tinny)
Wait wait dont, I'm literally outside the window, look left

PRIYA
(turning, a dog on the sidewalk pulling its owner past the glass)
omg that's Moonbeam?? they're like twelve??

MOONBEAM
(they push through the door, backpack sliding off one shoulder)
Fifteen. And they/them thank you. Hi. Please dont yell I brought snacks

PRIYA
(shouting, two teenagers at the next table turning to stare)
I AM NOT YELLING

JAYDEN
(shouting over her)
YOU ARE LITERALLY YELLING

DEVON
(arriving breathless, helmet still on)
Sorry im late guys the bus driver was a nightmare, wait. Why is everyone here a kid

PRIYA
(laughing despite herself, wiping her eyes)
because we are ALL kids Devon. every single one of us

MOONBEAM
(sitting, pushing the snacks to the middle of the table)
Ok so group chat is real now. Who's getting the garlic knots

JAYDEN
(grinning, finally pulling his hood down)
Me. I'm paying. Peace offering
